  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nBy using BODMAS and going by the options\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/de1d33ad9e4994409ac562645349ccb4be6795f42b9089bd7ca3ba04f830c7b5.png] \n\n**Given equation :- 25 * 7 * 56 * 8 * 88 * 14**\n\n**Interchanging * with signs given in the options **\n\n**Option. 1** +, -, =, ×, -\n\n25 * 7 * 56 * 8 * 88 * 14\n\n25 + 7 - 56 = **8 × 88** - 14 \n\n**25 + 7**- 56 = 704 -14\n\n**32 - 56** = **704 -14**\n\n-24 = 690\n\nLHS ≠ RHS \n\n**Option. 2 **-, +, ×, =, ÷ \n\n25 * 7 * 56 * 8 * 88 * 14\n\n25 - 7 + 56 × 8 = **88 ÷ 14**\n\n25 - 7 + **56 × 8** = 6.285\n\n**25 **- 7 **+ 448** = 6.285\n\n**473 - 7** = 6.285\n\n466 = 6.285\n\nLHS ≠ RHS \n\n**Option. 3** -, ×, ×, =, +\n\n25 * 7 * 56 * 8 * 88 * 14\n\n25 - **7 × 56 × 8** = 88 + 14\n\n25 - 3136 = **88 + 14**\n\n**25 - 3136 **= 102\n\n3111 = 102\n\nLHS ≠ RHS \n\n**Option. 4** +, ×, ÷, =, -\n\n25 * 7 * 56 * 8 * 88 * 14\n\n25 + 7 × **56 ÷ 8** = 88 - 14\n\n25 + **7 × 7** = 88 - 14\n\n**25 + 49** = 88 - 14\n\n74 = **88 - 14**\n\n74 = 74\n\nLHS = RHS\n\nTherefore, option \"+, ×, ÷, =, -\" satisfies the above equation. \n\nHence, the correct answer is \"+, ×, ÷, =, -\"",
